      "writtenOn": "2025-07-01T15:48:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed on the latter part, I addressed these comments going for the fOwnedCanvas approach. Also agree on not having to return a fully typed SkCaptureCanvas.\n\nWanted to clarify: Since the capture canvas returned is owned by the capture manager and not the surface_base, I assume that we\u0027d still want it to return a bare pointer here and just not double wrap it.",
