      "lineNbr": 20,
      "author": {
        "id": 11964
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-07-01T15:48:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think I addressed the double free (the SkSurface now sonly owns the base canvas, not the cached canvas that gets returned to the client) as well as the leak (SkSurface always owns the base canvas).\n\nThis issue bled into some other comments, so feel free to make another comment on the latest patch if I missed something.",
      "parentUuid": "342d6ebb_9c669e6b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 18,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 20,
        "endChar": 56
      },
      "revId": "2a1a838f87c71f11ee6476c5c8e7b74b12759486",
